        <item>
            <title>1.3.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:51:36 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/iodigital-com/macOS-app-releases/releases?q=numage-pro&amp;expanded=true</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Users can now explicitly select an own Keychain API key or a project from the shared Bonzai registry with a key read from 1Password, with jobs retaining the choice for all stages; Bonzai-shi is optional.
- Numage Pro defaults to Bonzai Vision Describe for image descriptions and the Bonzai Executor chat role for text compression and rewrites; image generation retains the Studio and Draft roles.
- Cost estimates are loaded only on request, rather than resolving credentials when opening description controls.
- Roundtrips stop on content refusals and retain completed rounds without automatically rewriting or retrying the refused prompt.
]]></description>
